# ============================================================
# Worktree — manage isolated working directories.
# Docs: https://opencode.ai/v2/docs/api
# ============================================================


### Create worktree
POST {{BASE_URL}}/api/worktree/{{projectID}}/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "feature/my-new-branch"
}

### List worktrees
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/worktree/{{projectID}}

### Refresh worktree
POST {{BASE_URL}}/api/worktree/{{projectID}}/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Remove worktree
DELETE {{BASE_URL}}/api/worktree/{{projectID}}/remove
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "feature/my-new-branch"
}
